				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="213" _ulen="165" >

ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
REG_DATE^등록일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
CANC_DATE^해지일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
SPLM_ATHN_NCSR_YN^추가인증필요여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
PPP_YN^팝업여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock2" inout="out" _len="67" _ulen="51" >

SCRC_OTP_CLS_CODE^보안카드OTP구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

